partshifter.sue is a generator that builds partitioned shifter/rotators.

it is not complete.  

it performs full minimization of the shift muxes, places the correct mux 
sizes, and correctly hooks up the data inputs and outputs.  it does not
hook up the shift signals, since minimization of the shift control wires
was beyond my interest.

it does print out all the necessary information on the shift wire equations
so that the user can decide how to share shift wires.  this information
appears on the schematic, as well as in a file called 
partshifter{options}.seldata.
